          <ul>
            <li>No mainnet support of any kind</li>
            <li>No packaged Windows, Linux, or Intel Mac builds</li>
            <li>No wallet onboarding, only the local testnet key</li>
            <li>No mobile app and no unattended trading with real funds</li>
